WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.747
This query first trims the email and converts it to
lowercase SPLIT_PART

00:00:06.774 --> 00:00:12.458
then returns the text before or after the at sign
POSITION reports

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:18.076
where the delimiter occurs Run the query and compare
the parsed user

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:23.684
and domain values Also notice what happens for
missing or malformed

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.644
email values
